# Frontend (React)

- Pages live under `src/app/pages/` using PascalCase component filenames
  (e.g. `Window.tsx`).
- Global styles: `src/app/styles/`. Module styles may live under
  `src/app/styles/modules/` when that tree already exists.
- Shared types: `src/app/types/` — put Tauri IPC types in `tauri.ts`.
- Call backend commands via Tauri `invoke()` with types from `types/tauri.ts`.
- When filling placeholders, keep the existing path/name intent; do not
  invent a second app tree.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD: src/components/Home.tsx (outside template layout)
// ✅ GOOD: src/app/pages/Home.tsx
```
